	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: For the baseline prediction cohort, “patients with missing values for certain regional parameters… were not included,” which is best classified as complete case analysis. Class imbalance handling such as weighting, oversampling, or SMOTE was not reported. Data preprocessing was described extensively: CT segmentation, central/distal airway definitions, lung/lobar volume extraction, and computational fluid dynamics-based resistance calculation. The paper reports train-test ratios, but because the absolute sample counts vary across repeated random partitions and dimensions, exact training and test N are NR. Code availability was not reported.  ￼

